 "summary": "A single planar Schottky barrier rectifier from the MEGA line, rated 40 V reverse and 1 A forward, with a built-in guard ring that protects the junction against stress. Forward drop is 490 mV typical and 570 mV maximum at 1 A. Two flat-lead surface-mount packages are offered: PMEG4010CEH in SOD123F and PMEG4010CEJ in SOD323F (SC-90). Intended uses are low-voltage rectification, efficient DC-to-DC converters, switched-mode supplies, reverse polarity protection and low-power equipment.",
